-- C8-GOALS-NO-DOD-1 (2026-11-05, charter pillars autonomy and research, programs QNFO.OPS and QNFO.RSCH; cluster C8-PROJECTS-GOALS of the roadmap and backlog completion sweep).
-- Read 2026-11-04 23:30Z: 41 adopted goals carry no machine-checkable DoD (metric goals_without_machine_dod 41), so the roadmap loop can neither complete nor reopen them and their GL- roadmap rows stay open for ever.
-- Each was read against the live fleet and given one disposition:
--   20 research hypotheses by the goal author (g14964ea62 ... gyt1wnr5h, 2026-09-14..27): superseded by the QNFO.RSCH charter and the research pipeline (DoD: a peer-reviewed publication or a measured prototype, which the fleet cannot produce or check;
--      the 2026-09-15 cleanup superseded three goals of the same author). The statements stay in goals for any later research queue item. decision_log row below, revert in the Rollback header.
--   13 engineering goals whose premise is gone or whose measurable half is carried by a live survivor (qnfo-agents, retired qnfo-signal-loop and qnfo-skill-sync, issues 1000459 and 1001754): superseded with the survivor named in the goal.
--   8 engineering goals given a machine-checkable DoD that measures the real outcome (the original wording is kept in front of it): 2 read met now (repo-mirror-drift-closeout, wrangler-deploy-fleet-control) and complete on their next probe;
--      ops-exec-loop-parse-guard and self-heal-tool-list-correction read met now as well; research-exec-newversion-draft-cleanup, fleet-loop-actuation-gap, cost-routing-stack-l0l7 and external-impact-per-dollar read unmet with their numbers and stay open with a doer.
-- A ROADMAP-1 issue with a code-task and anchor is filed for the one goal that needs new code (research-exec stuck newversion draft). No goal is closed by hand: completion needs the probe to pass in the hourly loop.
-- APPLY-BY: ci
-- DB: qnfo-audit
-- Rollback: UPDATE goals SET status = (SELECT b.status FROM bak_20261105_c8_goals b WHERE b.goal_key = goals.goal_key), dod = (SELECT b.dod FROM bak_20261105_c8_goals b WHERE b.goal_key = goals.goal_key), alignment = (SELECT b.alignment FROM bak_20261105_c8_goals b WHERE b.goal_key = goals.goal_key), retired_at = (SELECT b.retired_at FROM bak_20261105_c8_goals b WHERE b.goal_key = goals.goal_key), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE goal_key IN (SELECT goal_key FROM bak_20261105_c8_goals); DELETE FROM agent_issues WHERE title LIKE 'ROADMAP-1: QNFO.RSCH #c8-stuck-newversion:%'
-- CAUSE-MAPPED: no metric is registered here.

